      "id": "regardie",
      "title": "Regardie's print",
      "text": "The tablets exactly as Regardie prints them in 1940, from the Order's papers: in each square his higher letter, the one he prefers, and his smaller letters below it as second letters. In Water's row 5, square 12, where he prints four letters, two above two, the first of the upper pair stands. He prints no letter reversed.",
