      "differs": {
        "gd": "It prints one letter a square, often the lower of Regardie's two, and mostly Dee's 1584 letter where his two tables differ. Its Earth eighth row mixes the two tables' rows. It writes its reversed letters in Enochian, and the Golden Dawn's version reverses the same ones.",
        "regardie": "It prints one letter a square where Regardie prints two in many, and mostly the 1584 letter where he puts the 1587 one higher. Its reversed letters are in Enochian; Regardie prints them plain.",
