          "page": 15,
          "leaf": 456
        }
      ]
    },
    "air": {
      "text": "The Watchtower of the East, Air, in the Golden Dawn's attribution: Dee's ORO, the first table written down in 1584, whose middle line the angel called the great cross that came out of the East gate. Its Golden Dawn sigil is a Tau with four flames above it.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "work": "regardie1940",
          "page": 270,
          "leaf": 262
        },
        {
          "work": "regardie1940",
          "page": 307,
