      ]
    },
    "water": {
      "text": "The Watchtower of the West, Water, in the Golden Dawn's attribution: Dee's MPH. Regardie prints second letters in many of its squares, once four in one square. Its Golden Dawn sigil is a cross potent with b, 6, 4 and b in its angles; the Equinox sets the four figures differently.",
