    "union": {
      "text": "The Tablet of Union, by which the Golden Dawn joins the four Watchtowers: EXARP for Air, HCOMA for Water, NANTA for Earth and BITOM for Fire, the letters of Dee's Black Cross. It has no sigil, no variants in the Golden Dawn's sources, and no place in Dee's or Raphael's versions.",
